zar el paso de los alimentos por el est├│mago, se genera una absorci├│n m├ís gradual de los nutrientes, lo que previene las ca├¡das bruscas de energ├¡a durante el d├¡a.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Protecci├│n Contra Picos de Az├║car:</b> Permite que el cuerpo responda de forma eficiente a los carbohidratos, optimizando la secreci├│n de insulina seg├║n la demanda real del organismo y mejorando significativamente la sensibilidad a la misma.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Ficha T├®cnica y Especificaciones</h3>\r\n<table data-path-to-node=\"16\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Caracter├¡stica</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Detalle</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Concentraci├│n</b></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,1,1,0\">5 mg</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Formato</b></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2,1,0\">Vial con liofilizado (polvo seco purificado)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Clase</b></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,3,1,0\">Agonista del receptor de GLP-1</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Pureza</b></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,4,1,0\">&gt;98% (Grado de investigaci├│n / farmac├®utico)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Almacenamiento</b></span></td>\r\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"16,5,1,0\">Refrigerado entre 2┬░C y 8┬░C despu├®s de reconstituir. Proteger de la luz.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n